01:26:52.700 --> 01:26:54.200
1 more million? You ass!


01:26:54.300 --> 01:26:55.340
Screw you!


01:26:55.540 --> 01:26:56.410
Damn you!


01:26:56.510 --> 01:26:57.340
Pat!


01:27:04.580 --> 01:27:06.420
[What's wrong?]


01:27:13.260 --> 01:27:14.090
Damn!


01:27:15.890 --> 01:27:18.260
