01:31:14.830 --> 01:31:16.370
Step outside I said.


01:31:17.870 --> 01:31:18.800
Now!


01:31:18.970 --> 01:31:22.510
Someone have reported to us
that you are in there for too long.


01:31:22.840 --> 01:31:23.870
Come out.


01:31:24.870 --> 01:31:25.640
