01:37:12.060 --> 01:37:14.460
For Sale


01:37:23.470 --> 01:37:25.470
Don't we need to leave before 7:30 a.m.?


01:37:25.540 --> 01:37:26.470
Yeah!


01:37:26.900 --> 01:37:30.440
